WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:04.600
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No, Dr. Bright, you

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.660
cannot start the Power Rangers!

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:10.660
I know it's tempting, but the way to solve
containment breaches is not to gather a group

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.499
of troubled teenagers and give them superpowers.

00:00:13.499 --> 00:00:16.920
First of all, their parents are going to be
furious if you keep taking them out of school

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:17.920
for training.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.860
Second of all, do I even need to explain the
potential for lawsuits if they're lost in

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:26.600
the line of duty?

